---
<span class="tech-logo" set:html={svg}></span>

<style>
.tech-logo {
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
}

.tech-logo :global(svg) {
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  display: block;
}
</style>
